  "label": "Formal Event Attire",
  "description": "The image shows Michael J. Fox in a tuxedo, which is formal attire typically worn at high-profile events, galas, or red carpet appearances. This attire is associated with sophistication, celebration, and high status. The meme uses this visual contrast — the grandeur of formal wear juxtaposed with the mundane product — to create irony. The humor relies on the audience understanding the cultural significance of formal attire and how it contrasts with the implied low-quality or deceptive nature of the business.",
